---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Topics
description: Browse essays by topic — purple teaming, detection engineering, red teaming, OT security, and more.
permalink: /tags/
---

<section class="page shell">
  <header class="page__header">
    <p class="page__eyebrow">Topics</p>
    <h1 class="page__title">Browse by topic</h1>
    <p class="page__lede">Eleven essays, ten topics. Offence reads red, defence reads blue, purple team work reads purple.</p>
  </header>

  {# Bug 2 fix: read from the global data file that mirrors the same
     live-gate the Eleventy build applies to `collections.post`. #}
  {% set tagList = tagList %}
  {% if tagList and tagList.length %}
    <ul class="tag-grid" role="list">
      {% for entry in tagList %}
        <li class="tag-grid__item">
          <a href="/tags/{{ entry.slug }}/">
            <span class="tag-grid__name">{{ entry.name }}</span>
            <span class="tag-grid__count">{{ entry.count }} essay{% if entry.count != 1 %}s{% endif %}</span>
          </a>
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  {% else %}
    <p class="page__lede">No tagged essays yet.</p>
  {% endif %}
</section>
